{"id": "tep-0078", "text": "My defib refresher has lapsed and I am on the response rota from Sunday.", "gold": "act", "event_id": "jxy8mjohmvk371g", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "Find a defib refresher course for Alex before Sunday, August 23, 2026", "addressee": "self", "segment": "", "elapsed_s": 19.0, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:55:48.959Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:45:13.944Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
{"id": "tep-0081", "text": "My breathing apparatus competency is due for reassessment and the slots go in about a day.", "gold": "act", "event_id": "qs0mzlr5p037vyw", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "book breathing apparatus competency reassessment", "addressee": "self", "segment": "", "elapsed_s": 24.2, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:55:48.958Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:46:23.426Z", "said": [{"text": "Caught your plan \u2014 ready to go: Draft roadmap review dropping points. Say go and I'll book it.", "goal": "Draft roadmap review dropping points", "decision": "act"}], "jobs": []}
{"id": "tep-0087", "text": "I will put a marker on the address, actually no, leave it, that is the neighbouring force's job.", "gold": "ignore", "event_id": "lw8lcjvviolfk5v", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "", "addressee": "self", "segment": "", "elapsed_s": 14.3, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:55:50.602Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:46:10.820Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
{"id": "trd-0014", "text": "It is on the water till Thursday.", "gold": "ignore", "event_id": "awl86brs9s0ff7i", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "", "addressee": "self", "segment": "l1skqouva1azywa", "elapsed_s": 7.5, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:54:58.048Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:45:07.606Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
{"id": "trd-0015", "text": "The customs entry has never been lodged and if it is not in before arrival we are paying storage.", "gold": "act", "event_id": "anije2n1799ycpw", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "lodge customs entry for shipment arriving Thursday, August 27, 2026", "addressee": "self", "segment": "l1skqouva1azywa", "elapsed_s": 23.4, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:55:08.048Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:45:15.639Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
{"id": "trd-0022", "text": "I want the powerflush booked in at the Hendon flats but I cannot remember which one had the sludge.", "gold": "ask", "event_id": "ver9qo9fqs63abf", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "", "addressee": "self", "segment": "", "elapsed_s": 23.2, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:55:49.147Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:45:32.544Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
{"id": "trd-0028", "text": "The condenser is on the wagon already, it is all moving.", "gold": "ignore", "event_id": "jwuhbhdm0l9vcz7", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "", "addressee": "self", "segment": "", "elapsed_s": 22.3, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:55:48.922Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:45:52.994Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
{"id": "trd-0029", "text": "The Croydon landlord wants a heat pump price and I do not know if he means the flats or the office block.", "gold": "ask", "event_id": "vncx9u9wtt0zdas", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "", "addressee": "self", "segment": "", "elapsed_s": 19.9, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:55:58.161Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:46:43.144Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
{"id": "trd-0043", "text": "If we ever took structural steel on properly we would want a full welding procedure spec.", "gold": "ignore", "event_id": "fzbj7q0y4ayvefc", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "", "addressee": "self", "segment": "", "elapsed_s": 12.7, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:55:57.783Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:46:27.054Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
{"id": "trd-0069", "text": "If we ever went all in on resin we would need a different mixer altogether.", "gold": "ignore", "event_id": "2rjctaigpjr676e", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "", "addressee": "self", "segment": "iydqbttcgd3bndg", "elapsed_s": 18.9, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:55:58.048Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:45:41.108Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
{"id": "trd-0071", "text": "The gate will not let the two labourers on Monday, both their cards are out of date.", "gold": "act", "event_id": "uteuqm8hqhtrmja", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "", "addressee": "self", "segment": "", "elapsed_s": 13.1, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:56:39.635Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:45:16.782Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
{"id": "trd-0075", "text": "I will be out of hours before Carlisle at this rate and the planner needs telling now.", "gold": "act", "event_id": "qgguossdrqmn8jc", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "Email Alex about defib refresher lapse and response rota conflict", "addressee": "self", "segment": "", "elapsed_s": 39.5, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:56:38.959Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:45:35.693Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
{"id": "trd-0082", "text": "Two of the counterbalance lads need their refresher and the licences go in a fortnight.", "gold": "act", "event_id": "n9dsd1h9jh6hpo1", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "schedule counterbalance refresher for two lads before Friday, September 4, 2026", "addressee": "self", "segment": "uqtjboccduxobxp", "elapsed_s": 63.5, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:56:38.958Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:46:49.511Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
{"id": "trd-0084", "text": "I want the agency lads inducted before peak, though I have not settled how many shifts we are running.", "gold": "ask", "event_id": "d7dahrxhtyrhoxa", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "", "addressee": "self", "segment": "", "elapsed_s": 10.2, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:56:40.602Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:46:25.833Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
{"id": "trd-0086", "text": "The client wants the Lagos shipment quoting and I do not know if they will take groupage or want a full container.", "gold": "ask", "event_id": "ukre7wksrv9tx0i", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "", "addressee": "self", "segment": "", "elapsed_s": 21.1, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:56:39.147Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:45:57.342Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
{"id": "trd-0091", "text": "I should get the plate moved onto the new car, though I have not decided whether to keep the old one on the road.", "gold": "ask", "event_id": "nlb6pxsk87p4qkh", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "", "addressee": "self", "segment": "", "elapsed_s": 15.0, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:56:38.922Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:46:18.511Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
{"id": "trd-0094", "text": "The route card for the school run diversion has never been reissued and drivers are guessing.", "gold": "act", "event_id": "jsrd3shet502eot", "decision": "act", "goal": "reissue school run diversion route card", "addressee": "self", "segment": "", "elapsed_s": 45.6, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:56:48.161Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:47:10.840Z", "said": [], "jobs": [{"id": "1oawde7y2n0desq", "status": "awaiting_confirm", "lane": "", "goal": "reissue school run diversion route card"}]}
{"id": "trd-0095", "text": "And that is the traffic and travel, back to the studio.", "gold": "ignore", "event_id": "mgzt2v9kspod9vu", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "", "addressee": "self", "segment": "", "elapsed_s": 32.2, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:56:47.783Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:46:41.620Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
{"id": "trd-0096", "text": "Nobody has signed the possession paperwork for Saturday night and it is Thursday.", "gold": "act", "event_id": "hq6qntyljxtfru2", "decision": "ignore", "goal": "get possession paperwork signed for Saturday, August 22, 2026", "addressee": "self", "segment": "", "elapsed_s": 31.8, "capture_started_at": "2026-08-21T16:56:48.048Z", "pushed_at": "2026-08-21T16:46:01.426Z", "said": [], "jobs": []}
